        <mxCell id="legend_panel" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#c4ceda;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="96.0" y="3968.0" width="4352.0" height="488.0" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_0" value="图例：矩形为实体，菱形为联系；下划线为主码（多项合为联合主码）；AK / 同组 AK1 为候选码辅助标记。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#22334a;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="3985.6000000000004" width="4288.0" height="44.800000000000004" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_1" value="? 为原字段可空；/ 为派生属性；本端参与次数：1..1 恰好一次，0..1 可选一次，0..* 可选多次，1..* 至少一次。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#22334a;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="4033.6000000000004" width="4288.0" height="44.800000000000004" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_2" value="N 为条件附注；U1 为已验证的采购限制；Δ2 为整单到货仍有流程缺口。其他说明见本周数据字典。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#22334a;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="4081.6000000000004" width="4288.0" height="44.800000000000004" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N01_0" value="N01  角色非空则 IP 非空，角色与 IP 必须一致；v0.1 已有组合约束。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#34485e;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="4155.2" width="2112.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N02_0" value="N02  商品资料先于预售、采购；首次验收入库后必须有库存记录。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#34485e;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="4208.0" width="2112.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N03_0" value="N03  创建订单可无明细；完成时至少一条；完成后固定交易内容。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#34485e;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="4260.8" width="2112.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N04_0" value="N04  SPOT 可无会员且不关联预订；PRESALE 必须关联同会员预订，整体提货。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#34485e;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="4313.6" width="2112.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N05_0" value="N05  U1 同活动最多一张采购单；预售单关联活动，普通补货不关联。三项限制见本周字典。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#945400;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2296.0" y="4155.2" width="2112.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N06_0" value="N06  Δ2 部分到货状态已移除；received_qty 保留，数量与整单状态一致性未强制。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#945400;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2296.0" y="4208.0" width="2112.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N07_0" value="N07  实际采购与验收有明细；预售单明细商品匹配活动，普通补货可多商品。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#34485e;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2296.0" y="4260.8" width="2112.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N08_0" value="N08  员工联系分别表示收银、创建或验收；外键存在不等于业务职责正确。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#34485e;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2296.0" y="4313.6" width="2112.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
