        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_0" value="图例：矩形为实体，菱形为联系；下划线为主码（多项合为联合主码）；AK / 同组 AK1 为候选码辅助标记。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#22334a;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="1729.6000000000001" width="2592.0" height="44.800000000000004" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_1" value="? 为原字段可空；/ 为派生属性；本端参与次数：1..1 恰好一次，0..1 可选一次，0..* 可选多次，1..* 至少一次。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#22334a;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="1777.6000000000001" width="2592.0" height="44.800000000000004" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_2" value="N 为条件附注；U1 为已验证的采购限制；Δ2 为整单到货仍有流程缺口。其他说明见本周数据字典。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#22334a;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="1825.6000000000001" width="2592.0" height="44.800000000000004" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N03_0" value="N03  创建订单可无明细；完成时至少一条；完成后固定交易内容。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#34485e;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="1899.2" width="2528.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N04_0" value="N04  SPOT 可无会员且不关联预订；PRESALE 必须关联同会员预订，整体提货。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#34485e;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="1952.0" width="2528.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_N08_0" value="N08  员工联系分别表示收银、创建或验收；外键存在不等于业务职责正确。" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=24;fontColor=#34485e;fontStyle=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="128.0" y="2004.8000000000002" width="2528.0" height="41.6" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
